WEBVTT

00:01:28.876 --> 00:01:32.547
And how can metaverses
make the real world a better place?

00:01:33.297 --> 00:01:36.050
And there are, of course,
many answers to these questions,

00:01:36.092 --> 00:01:38.928
and I cannot give you the answer,

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:41.889
but I can give you one answer.

00:01:42.515 --> 00:01:45.977
If, instead of talking
about the metaverse,

00:01:45.977 --> 00:01:49.105
we talked about thousands
or millions of metaverses

00:01:49.105 --> 00:01:52.316
created by people
from all around the world,

00:01:52.358 --> 00:01:54.318
it would be much more inclusive

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:56.654
and less risk of toxic uses.

00:01:57.029 --> 00:01:59.282
To me, that sounds quite lovely.